ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh062 - Merging adjacent same-surface faces returns a topologically invalid shape on Boolean result
 * Stand-in for a Boolean-fuse of 5 cylinders: 5 ADVANCED_FACEs on 5 distinct
 * CYLINDRICAL_SURFACEs, each bounded by two CIRCLE arcs and two seam LINEs.
 * Wrapped as one OPEN_SHELL to mimic a fused complex topology. */
